{
  "v": 1,
  "title": "Wote 3.0 Guide & Manual",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "i": "h-intro",
      "t": "heading1",
      "c": "Welcome to Wote 3.0!",
      "ch": [
        {
          "i": "h-tagline",
          "t": "text",
          "c": "A distraction-free, tree-structured outliner workspace designed for the web.",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "h-callout-welcome",
          "t": "callout",
          "co": "tip",
          "c": "Interactive Guide: This manual is a real, live Wote document! Feel free to click, edit, expand, drag, and test everything right here.",
          "ch": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": "h-mouse",
      "t": "heading2",
      "c": "1. Mouse Controls & Visual Superpowers",
      "ch": [
        {
          "i": "h-zoom",
          "t": "text",
          "c": "Bullet Zoom (Focus Mode): Click the dot on the left of this bullet to zoom into this branch!",
          "ch": [
            {
              "i": "h-zoom-sub1",
              "t": "text",
              "c": "Notice how the rest of the document fades away and breadcrumbs appear at the top?",
              "ch": []
            },
            {
              "i": "h-zoom-sub2",
              "t": "text",
              "c": "Click \"Root\" in the top bar or press Esc anytime to return to the full document.",
              "ch": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "i": "h-drag",
          "t": "text",
          "c": "Drag-and-Drop: Hover over this line and grab the 6-dot grip handle to move or nest notes visually.",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "h-collapse",
          "t": "text",
          "c": "Expand & Collapse: Click the chevron arrow to fold thoughts away.",
          "cl": true,
          "ch": [
            {
              "i": "h-secret-1",
              "t": "callout",
              "co": "success",
              "c": "You found the collapsed note! Notice the counter badge (+2) when folded.",
              "ch": []
            },
            {
              "i": "h-secret-2",
              "t": "text",
              "c": "Collapsing keeps long outlines clean and focused.",
              "ch": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "i": "h-hover-bar",
          "t": "text",
          "c": "Hover Quick Actions: Hover to the right of any line to quickly add a child (+), switch block type, or delete.",
          "ch": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": "h-blocks",
      "t": "heading2",
      "c": "2. Dedicated Block Types & The Slash Menu",
      "ch": [
        {
          "i": "h-slash",
          "t": "callout",
          "co": "info",
          "c": "Type / on any empty line to summon the Command Menu and pick any block type.",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "h-todo-example",
          "t": "todo",
          "ck": true,
          "c": "Interactive To-Dos: Click this checkbox to toggle complete with strikethrough!",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "h-todo-2",
          "t": "todo",
          "ck": false,
          "c": "Press Enter from a to-do to create another task immediately.",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "h-quote-example",
          "t": "quote",
          "c": "Simplicity is about subtracting the obvious and adding the meaningful. — John Maeda",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "h-code-example",
          "t": "code",
          "l": "typescript",
          "c": "// Code blocks feature syntax highlighting and a 1-click Copy button!\ninterface WoteNote {\n  id: string;\n  type: \"text\" | \"heading1\" | \"todo\" | \"code\" | \"quote\" | \"callout\";\n  children: WoteNote[];\n}\n\nconsole.log(\"Distraction-free outliner ready!\");",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "h-div",
          "t": "divider",
          "c": "",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "h-img-tip",
          "t": "text",
          "c": "Clipboard Image Paste: Copy any image or screenshot to your clipboard and hit Ctrl+V right here!",
          "ch": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": "h-keyboard",
      "t": "heading2",
      "c": "3. Keyboard Shortcuts & Workflow",
      "ch": [
        {
          "i": "k-enter",
          "t": "todo",
          "ck": true,
          "c": "Enter: Create a new sibling note below",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "k-tab",
          "t": "todo",
          "ck": true,
          "c": "Tab: Indent / nest note under the previous item",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "k-outdent",
          "t": "todo",
          "ck": true,
          "c": "Shift + Tab: Outdent note back up a level",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "k-nav",
          "t": "todo",
          "ck": true,
          "c": "Alt + Up / Down: Move cursor focus smoothly between notes",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "k-collapse",
          "t": "todo",
          "ck": true,
          "c": "Ctrl + /: Toggle collapse/expand on current branch",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "k-search",
          "t": "todo",
          "ck": true,
          "c": "Ctrl + K: Quick Search across all bullets in the document",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "k-history",
          "t": "todo",
          "ck": true,
          "c": "Ctrl + Z & Ctrl + Y: Full undo / redo history stack",
          "ch": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": "h-library",
      "t": "heading2",
      "c": "4. Document Library & Exporting",
      "ch": [
        {
          "i": "lib-1",
          "t": "text",
          "c": "Notes Drawer: Click \"Notes\" at the top left to manage multiple saved documents, filter, or create new Wotes.",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "lib-2",
          "t": "text",
          "c": "Exporting: Export your work anytime as a native .wote file or as standard clean Markdown (.md).",
          "ch": []
        },
        {
          "i": "lib-3",
          "t": "callout",
          "co": "success",
          "c": "All your documents are automatically saved in your browser storage locally with crash recovery.",
          "ch": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
